+#### Web push (optional)
+
+To deliver tray notifications to phones and desktops, set a VAPID key pair:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`
+
+Generate them with:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts key.public_key; puts key.private_key'
